<title>POLAND: Bank Gdanski trades on kerb at PLN 36.5.</title>
<headline>Bank Gdanski trades on kerb at PLN 36.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 1,438 shares in Bank Gdanski at 36.5 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Bank Gdanski fell 0.7 percent to 40 zlotys in 7,032 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
